	(text "03 - Camera and Gimbal\n22-pin 0.5mm FPC, Raspberry Pi Zero CSI pinout: OV5647 head on a flex, 2-lane MIPI CSI-2.\nThe module regulates its own rails from 3.3V and carries its oscillator: no LDOs, no clock buffer on this board.\nI2C is the board's shared bus (pull-ups on sheet 02). CAM_EN drives the module's enable through 100R." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00004-0000-4000-8000-000000000086"))
